### Test Sandbox Environment
### Base URL: https://localhost:7000 (Development)
### Base URL: https://your-domain.com (Production)

### 1. Test Sandbox Transaction Creation
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/test/sandbox
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100000,
  "description": "Test transaction for sandbox environment"
}

### 2. Test Webhook Processing
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/test/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": 123456,
  "amount": 50000,
  "accountNumber": "TEST_ACCOUNT_001",
  "description": "Test webhook processing"
}

### 3. Test Real Webhook (Simulate SePay webhook)
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer sandbox-api-key-here
X-Sepay-Signature: test-signature-here

{
  "transactionId": 789012,
  "transactionDate": 1704067200,
  "accountNumber": "1234567890",
  "subAccount": "SUB001",
  "amountIn": 75000,
  "amountOut": 0,
  "accumulated": 75000,
  "code": "PAYMENT_CODE",
  "transactionContent": "Payment for order #12345",
  "referenceNumber": "REF_20240101_001",
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 4. Get Transaction by ID
GET https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/transactions/123456

### 5. Get Transactions by Date Range
GET https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/transactions?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31&pageIndex=1&pageSize=10

### 6. Update Transaction Status
PUT https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/transactions/123456/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed",
  "errorMessage": null
}

### 7. Test with different amounts
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/test/sandbox
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 250000,
  "description": "Large amount test transaction"
}

### 8. Test with minimal amount
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/test/sandbox
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000,
  "description": "Minimal amount test"
}

### 9. Test webhook with different status
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/test/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": 999999,
  "amount": 100000,
  "accountNumber": "TEST_ACCOUNT_002",
  "description": "Test webhook with different account"
}

### 10. Test error scenarios - Invalid transaction ID
GET https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/transactions/invalid-id

### 11. Test error scenarios - Invalid date range
GET https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/transactions?startDate=invalid-date&endDate=2024-01-31

### 12. Test with empty request body
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/test/sandbox
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 13. Test with negative amount
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/test/sandbox
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -1000,
  "description": "Negative amount test"
}

### 14. Test with very large amount
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/test/sandbox
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 999999999,
  "description": "Very large amount test"
}

### 15. Test webhook without signature
POST https://localhost:7000/api/sepay/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": 111111,
  "transactionDate": 1704067200,
  "accountNumber": "1234567890",
  "subAccount": "SUB001",
  "amountIn": 50000,
  "amountOut": 0,
  "accumulated": 50000,
  "code": "PAYMENT_CODE",
  "transactionContent": "Payment without signature",
  "referenceNumber": "REF_20240101_002",
  "status": "Pending"
}
